{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-ostra-palace-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"ostra-palace-villas-emaar-properties-the-oasis","about":"Palace Ostra Villas at The Oasis is a first Palace-branded villa community in Dubai by Emaar, offering an unparalleled standard of ultra-luxury living in Dubai. Positioned opposite Address Villas Tierra, another prestigious Emaar development, this exclusive enclave features 4, 5, and 6-bedroom villas with expansive layouts, open-style basements, rooftop terraces, and pool access. With fewer units spread across a vast master-planned area, Ostra Palace Villas ensures privacy, exclusivity, and a refined lifestyle. Every home is meticulously designed with premium finishes, high ceilings, and floor-to-ceiling windows, creating a seamless blend of sophistication and comfort.Located within The Oasis, Ostra Palace Villas offers seamless access to Sheikh Zayed Road, Al Maktoum International Airport, and Expo City Dubai. The development features resort-style amenities, including a swimmable lagoon, a private beach area, fitness stations, sports courts, and lush green landscapes. With its strategic location, exceptional design, and strong investment potential, Ostra Palace Villas stands as one of the most exclusive villa communities in Dubai, offering a rare opportunity for luxury living and high capital appreciation.","price":13300000,"title":"Ostra Palace Villas","bitrix":{"id":1154,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Ostra Palace Villas","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Ostra Palace Villas","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"The Oasis"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Ostra_Palace_Villas_at_The_Oasis_e13311432a.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Ostra_Palace_Villas_at_The_Oasis_e13311432a.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geo